  "details": "Something I really, really wish existed in vrchat is the ability to have clothes and props as something that I could equip to my avatar separately, that way I don't technically count as having all clothing and all props 'equipped' at all times (but disabled through toggles), decreasing everyone's performance despite them being disabled.\n\nI know that I can easily just upload different avatars with said outfits or props separate, but the mixing and matching of outfits would be impossible unless I specifically upload a whole other avatar with the express purpose of doing so.\n\nI would imagine the way it would work is by having either a wardrobe system for props and outfits separate from avatars, or you would have them in a menu attached to each individual avatar, that way they can be loaded in/instantiated on demand.\n\nThis would also benefit the new marketplace because people would be able to sell clothing and whatnot for avatar bases, and people could potentially buy the clothing or props to be used directly within vrchat.",
